// A fighting style (`content::actors::MovesSpec`): a move for each way a
// swipe can go from where the mover faces (forward, left, right, back). A
// move plays when one of its cells (drawn as for weapons, the mover `@`
// facing up) holds a target; otherwise the swipe is a plain step. It hits
// each target in its cells in order (only the first, with `stop: true`) for
// `hit` damage, and knocks each `knock` cells the way the swing goes
// through its cell, plus one the way the mover steps, if it does (the blow
// carries its step). `stance` is where it leaves the mover: `Stay`,
// `Follow` into the cell the first knocked target leaves, or `Step` the way
// of the swipe; with `turn` the mover turns to face the swipe. `swing` and
// `streak` are how it looks, as for weapons (no swing when not given).
//
// The blade: every move moves the mover; an attack is a step that hits
// what it meets.
(
    // Into what is ahead, knocking it on and taking its cell.
    forward: (name: "lunge", hit: 1, knock: 1, stance: Follow,
        swing: Thrust(reach: 0.6), streak: Swoosh, art: "
        1
        @
    "),
    // Round from ahead to the side, stepping that way and turning to face
    // it: what is ahead is swept aside, what is beside is swept back, out
    // of the cell stepped into.
    left: (name: "sweep left", hit: 1, knock: 1, stance: Step, turn: true,
        swing: Sweep(reach: 0.55), streak: Swoosh, art: "
        21
        3@
    "),
    right: (name: "sweep right", hit: 1, knock: 1, stance: Step, turn: true,
        swing: Sweep(reach: 0.55), streak: Swoosh, art: "
        12
        @3
    "),
    // Facing something, a step back keeps facing it.
    back: (name: "back off", stance: Step, art: "
        x
        @
    "),
)
